---
// System / Pricing - ballaholic style: clean cards
---

<section class="system section--white" id="system">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="system__header fade-up" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 64px;">
      <span class="section-label">Price</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">料金システム</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle" style="margin: 0 auto;">
        あなたのライフスタイルに合わせたプランをご用意しています。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="system__grid">
      <!-- Trial -->
      <div class="system__card card fade-up">
        <span class="system__plan-label tag">TRIAL</span>
        <h3 class="system__plan-name">体験</h3>
        <div class="system__price">
          <span class="system__price-value">無料</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="system__features">
          <li>見学・体験ともに無料</li>
          <li>動きやすい服装で手ぶらOK</li>
          <li>お気軽にお越しください</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline">体験予約</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Regular - Featured -->
      <div class="system__card card card--featured fade-up">
        <span class="system__plan-label tag tag--filled" style="background:#fff;color:#FF5E1A;border-color:#fff;">RECOMMENDED</span>
        <h3 class="system__plan-name" style="color:#fff;">一般会員</h3>
        <div class="system__price">
          <span class="system__price-yen" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">¥</span>
          <span class="system__price-value" style="color:#fff;">8,800</span>
          <span class="system__price-unit" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">/月</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="system__features" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.8);">
          <li>全クラス受講可能</li>
          <li>フリーマット利用可</li>
          <li>レンタル道着あり</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--white">入会お問い合わせ</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Family -->
      <div class="system__card card fade-up">
        <span class="system__plan-label tag">FAMILY</span>
        <h3 class="system__plan-name">家族会員</h3>
        <div class="system__price">
          <span class="system__price-value">お問い合わせ</span>
        </div>
        <ul class="system__features">
          <li>ご家族でお得に入会</li>
          <li>親子で柔術を楽しめます</li>
          <li>詳細はお問い合わせください</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn--outline">詳細を問い合わせ</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .system {
    padding: 120px 0;
  }

  .system__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .system__card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 48px 32px;
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1),
                box-shadow 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .system__card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  .system__card.card--featured {
    background: #FF5E1A;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .system__plan-label {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 4px 14px;
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-radius: 60px;
    border: 1.5px solid #FF5E1A;
    color: #FF5E1A;
  }

  .system__card .btn {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 60px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .system__card .btn--outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  }

  .system__card .btn--outline:hover {
    border-color: #FF5E1A;
    color: #FF5E1A;
  }

  .system__card .btn--white {
    background: #fff;
    color: #1A1A1A;
    border: none;
  }

  .system__card .btn--white:hover {
    background: #F5F2EE;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .system__plan-name {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .system__price {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 4px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .system__price-yen {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #888;
  }

  .system__price-value {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .system__price-unit {
    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: #888;
  }

  .system__features {
    list-style: none;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .system__features li {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #666;
    padding: 8px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .system__features li:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .system__card .btn {
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .system__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      max-width: 400px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .system { padding: 80px 0; }
  }
</style>
